    "detailed_description": "This is  ESTEN<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700600/extras/8d7ff4fbce99ba870ab658a4a2f9a1fe.avif?t=1742545480\" /></div><br><br>A non-auto-scrolling horizontal bullet hell that focuses on highly experimental close-range combat, mainly revolving around your {Shotgun Options}<br><br>Playing as Mik you can Dash and Blast through 9 Full Levels, going up against Aliens, Drones, and Angels alike.<br><br>Get up close to your enemies and blast them away with a close-ranged energy shot,<br>Dash around at high speeds to get through levels at your own pace,<br><br><br>Face the ~Main Campaign~ or test your objective skill in the highly randomized, rouge lite  [Time Challenge Mode]<br><br>Good Luck, and may Heaven smile upon you!",
